<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities initiated coverage of Sports Authority Inc TSA.N as a strong buy and set a 12-month price target of $29 a share, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Sports Authority was unchanged at 18-7/8.</p>
</text>
